        <mxCell id="i-notes-lines" value="Blue: application/HTTPS traffic   •   Purple: bootstrap administrative DB traffic   •   Dashed green: identity and authorization&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Security groups and NetworkPolicy control TCP reachability. IAM permits the database login; SQL grants limit operations.&lt;br&gt;The app signs a fresh IAM token when opening a connection. Token expiry does not end an already established session." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#52677A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
